  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 25 11}感谢您接受委托。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_310.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 E7 0E}这次的委托是讨伐\n{F2 01 03 01}时钟塔{F2 01 01 01}的Ｆ．Ｏ．Ｅ……\n{F2 01 03 01}“收割者”{F2 01 01 01}。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_310.bf.json:0:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}它是时钟塔迷宫中\n号称最强的Ｆ．Ｏ．Ｅ。\n建议您做好充分准备再挑战。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_310.bf.json:0:3",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}此外，请带回\n{F2 01 03 01}“断裂的锁链”{F2 01 01 01}，\n作为讨伐成功的证明。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_310.bf.json:0:4",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 CF 0E}这是连我都没能战胜的强敌。\n还请您多加小心。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
